{"info": {"author": "", "author_email": "sudosubin <sudosubin@gmail.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Development Status :: 2 - Pre-Alpha", "Environment :: Console", "Intended Audience :: Developers", "License :: OSI Approved :: MIT License", "Operating System :: OS Independent", "Programming Language :: Python", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3 :: Only", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.9", "Topic :: Software Development :: Libraries :: Python Modules", "Typing :: Typed"], "description": "# `actions-python-core`\n\n> Core functions for setting results, logging, registering secrets and exporting variables across actions\n\n## Usage\n\n### Import the package\n\n```python\nfrom actions import core\n```\n\n#### Inputs/Outputs\n\nAction inputs can be read with `get_input` which returns a `str` or `get_boolean_input` which parses a boolean based on the [yaml 1.2 specification](https://yaml.org/spec/1.2/spec.html#id2804923). If `required` set to be false, the input should have a default value in `action.yml`.\n\nOutputs can be set with `set_output` which makes them available to be mapped into inputs of other actions to ensure they are decoupled.\n\n```python\nmy_input = core.get_input(\"input_name\", required=True)\nmy_boolean_input = core.get_boolean_input(\"boolean_input_name\", required=True)\nmy_multiline_input = core.get_multiline_input(\"multiline_input_name\", required=True)\n\ncore.set_output(\"output_key\", \"output_value\")\n```\n\n#### TBD\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": "", "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": "", "keywords": "action,ci,github", "license": "", "license_expression": null, "license_files": null, "maintainer": "", "maintainer_email": "", "name": "actions-python-core", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/actions-python-core/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/actions-python-core/", "project_urls": {"Homepage": "https://github.com/actions-python/toolkit"}, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/actions-python-core/0.1.3/", "requires_dist": ["aiofiles>=23.1", "httpx<1.0.0,>=0.23", "typing-extensions>=4.6; python_version < '3.11'"], "requires_python": ">=3.9", "summary": "Actions core lib", "version": "0.1.3", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "releases": {"0.1.1": [{"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": {"sha256": "2b7a6fb9862822cc2f16852960d5d1c46cd82514fe758dee3aaad51230d29f7a"}, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "619670e75ee90758d45b299e2d664ef40a99ed567bcf00418cd9cf89ec99b212", "md5": "dbf02b38bb7f4f3f8376f6f30a11c534", "sha256": "adf72932791f29281495fb8914ab37105d4b4ce12273cbf5915be5345005300a"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "actions_python_core-0.1.1-py3-none-any.whl", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "dbf02b38bb7f4f3f8376f6f30a11c534", "packagetype": "bdist_wheel", "python_version": "py3", "requires_python": ">=3.8", "size": 11857, "upload_time": "2023-09-30T07:41:00", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2023-09-30T07:41:00.683490Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/61/96/70e75ee90758d45b299e2d664ef40a99ed567bcf00418cd9cf89ec99b212/actions_python_core-0.1.1-py3-none-any.whl", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, {"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": false, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "6fa855aa6842ee884083a5c42ef1d6264fe78e7320c2fd28f9bc2fdc58cc6106", "md5": "bd0caebadba9675d4c33d5801cfeac99", "sha256": "23b417bcb2002747e9dc95e43e969263ca098a3ff243953232484ac787c81aff"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "actions_python_core-0.1.1.tar.gz", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "bd0caebadba9675d4c33d5801cfeac99", "packagetype": "sdist", "python_version": "source", "requires_python": ">=3.8", "size": 11256, "upload_time": "2023-09-30T07:40:58", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2023-09-30T07:40:58.934233Z", "u